se},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}","display":false},{"tex":"x_0,\\ldots,x_{n-1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sat}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_T,\\operatorname{Complete}_{T,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\varphi\\models_T\\psi\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\forall s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\psi)\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Complete}_{T,n}(\\varphi)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\n\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\exists s\\in\\mathrm{Assign}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_L(\\mathfrak{A},s,\\varphi)\\\\\n&\\land\n\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\;\n(\\varphi\\models_T\\psi\\lor\\varphi\\models_T\\neg\\psi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":2547,"backlinks":[{"id":"caec72ff0a2438f3","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}_{T,n}$ (complete-formula predicate, see [[17-df-complete-formula]])"},{"id":"b0923b75f2632493","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$，见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$n\\in\\omega$ 且 $\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$，见 [[17-df-type]]。$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]；$\\varphi\\models_T\\psi$ 取 [[17-df-complete-formula]] 的相对后承。以下在这些输入上定义 $\\operatorname{LocallyRealizes}_{T,n}$ 与 $\\operatorname{LocallyOmits}_{T,n}$；语言由 $T$ 的指定语境 $L$ 固定。"},{"id":"a628b44ab2781524","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$|L|$ 与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；$\\operatorname{Complete}$ 见 [[17-df-theory-properties]]；$\\operatorname{Mod}(T)$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。$\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-type]]；$\\models_T$ 与 $\\operatorname{Complete}_{T,n}$ 见 [[17-df-complete-formula]]；$\\operatorname{Atomic}_T$ 见 [[17-df-atomic-model]]。实现公式集谓词 $\\operatorname{Realizes}_{L,n}$ 见 [[17-df-realizing-omitting-formula-sets]]。证明使用 [[17-df-local-omission]] 的局部省略及 [[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-complete-formula]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]]\n[[17-df-elementary-chain]]\n[[17-df-elementary-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]\n[[17-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[17-df-elementary-extension]]\n[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[17-df-embedding]]\n[[17-df-embedding